<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      a {
        color: #007bff;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
      ul {
        padding-left: 20px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Hello <%= approverName %>,</p>
    <p>
      The BOM document titled "<strong><%= bomDocument.name %></strong>" has been approved by the first-level approver and is now assigned to you for the second-level review and approval.
    </p>

    <p><strong>Document Details:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Title:</strong> <%= bomDocument.name %></li>
      <li><strong>Document ID:</strong> <%= bomDocument.id %></li>
      <li><strong>Description:</strong> <%= bomDocument.description %></li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Please click the link below to review the document and proceed with approval:
      <br>
      <a href="<%= bomDocument.link %>">Review Document</a>
    </p>

    <p>Best regards,<br>Your Team</p>
  </body>
</html>
